From 9723e6c9dfeb879dd260d24f62ce96b10d6257a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JingMatrix <jingmatrix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:20:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/47] Add the profile-based WebUI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A modular ES-module WebUI served from the module's webroot: a config editor over config.json profiles, a keybox manager (import, rename, delete), a stored-key manager, a status panel, and a live log view — each reaching the daemon's KeyAdmin endpoint through one transport seam. Only the bridge names the root manager; the UI layer never touches I/O.
